    <p class="font-medium text-[var(--text)]">Education, not a protocol</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--text)]">
      This page explains the biology of congenital adrenal hyperplasia. It is not medical
      advice and gives no dosing or treatment instructions. CAH requires lifelong specialist
      care, and an adrenal crisis is a medical emergency. See the{' '}
      <a href="/about">editorial standards</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

